[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="夜里下起很细的雨。德雷顿在船尾晾那条你借过的毯子，晾了半天，发现越晾越湿，只好连衣架一起搬回走廊。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我来吧。说好了我洗。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="明天。今天它已经比你先累了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她给你留出旁边的位置。港口的灯倒在水里，常常被船经过的尾浪搅碎，过一会儿又自己拼起来。你盯着看，终于不再觉得每一块黑水下面都有东西等着。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我今天有一瞬间想跟那个声音走。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我猜到了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你不生气？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="有点。我把人从海里捞回来，他转头就想自己跳回去，总得让我有点意见吧。"

tone="concern"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她说完偏过脸，像是在给你留出反驳的机会。你没反驳。那一点坦白的生气，比一句“我相信你”更容易接住。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="下次我会先告诉你们。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="下次我们也可能不同意。你得听完再做决定。"

tone="concern"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="好。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻抱着维修图经过，见你们都坐在门口，把原本要说的事停了一下。她最后只把一串钥匙放到你手边。钥匙新磨过，边上还有一点铁屑。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="房间的。里面柜子没锁，不是防你，是锁坏了。想放东西的话，明天我找人来修。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我没有什么东西。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="会有的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她没有把这句话说得很郑重，像在说迟早会补上缺的螺丝。你把钥匙攥了一会儿，掌心留下两道浅浅的印子，终于有了一样能放进口袋的东西。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="明早还是那个点。左锅汤，右锅颜料——哎，等一下，我刚才是不是说反了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "calm"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我会先闻。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "calm"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她笑出声。有人从走廊另一端喊你们小声一点。你们都压低了声音，却谁也没马上起身，像再坐一会儿，就能让这一天完整地过去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"drayton": "calm"}

